4. Do you have other business expenses not listed (software, travel, advertising, supplies, health insurance self‑employed premium, etc.)?
5. Do you have 1099‑NEC forms from clients or were any clients W‑2 employers? (Helpful for verifying self‑employment income.)

Recommendations
- Likely take the standard deduction for 2023 (MFJ) while still claiming Schedule C business deductions (home office, unreimbursed business expenses).
