Key assumptions and clarifying questions (please answer these so I can give precise numbers)
- Is the $22,100 “additional income” self‑employment income (you were an independent contractor / had 6 clients) or something else (e.g., side W‑2)? I’ll assume it’s self‑employment income unless you tell me otherwise.
