- Because you have self‑employment income, you likely owe self‑employment tax and possibly additional income tax beyond what is withheld from your W‑2. If you expect to owe $1,000+ when filing, you should make estimated tax payments (Form 1040‑ES) or increase withholding to avoid penalties.

