- Save receipts for the charity, business expenses, and any home-office-related bills (utilities, renter’s insurance, etc.).
- Compare the home office deduction by both methods (regular vs simplified) — the regular method seems to give a much larger deduction for your numbers (≈$4,330 vs $650), but weigh the paperwork tradeoff (Form 8829).
