- Form 8949 / Schedule D only if you have reportable capital gains from brokerage activity (check your TD Ameritrade 1099‑B)

State (Illinois)
- IL‑1040 (Illinois individual income tax return). Illinois has a flat tax (rate was 4.95% in 2023) and generally follows federal AGI with some additions/subtractions — confirm any state adjustments with the IL forms or a tax preparer.

