Option B — Simplified method:
- Home-office deduction = 130 sq ft × $5 = $650.

Which is better here? Regular method (rent share ~$4,330) is substantially larger than simplified ($650), so the regular method is likely better for you — assuming you meet exclusive-use rules and you want to use rent as the allocable expense.

Effect on self-employment income and SE tax (illustrative)
