- 1098-E or loan statements showing 2023 student loan interest paid
- Receipts for business expenses and charitable contributions (Habitat for Humanity receipt)
- Records showing home office square footage and total square footage, rent/mortgage statements, utility bills, homeowner/renter insurance, repair bills

