- Self-employment tax ≈ 15.3% × $15,171 ≈ $2,320
- Half SE tax deduction ≈ $1,160 (adjustment to income)
- Student loan interest deduction (max allowed before phaseout) = up to $2,500 (you reported $4,800 paid, but deduction capped at $2,500 and may be phased out by income)
