- Use the standard deduction ($27,700) on Form 1040 unless you have significant other itemized deductions (mortgage interest, large property taxes or other large itemizable amounts).  
- Student loan interest: confirm how much interest you actually paid in 2023. If you paid interest in 2023 and your MAGI is below the phaseout, you can claim up to $2,500 (subject to limits). If the $4,800 is from prior years, it cannot be claimed on the 2023 return.

