- IL‑1040 resident return (report all income; Illinois has a flat tax — you’ll include your federal AGI).
- Any required IL schedules depending on credits or additions/subtractions.

7) Other practical notes / red flags
- Keep receipts and documentation for the home office (floor plan, measurements, rent statements, utility bills, and records showing exclusive business use).
