Important clarifying questions (please answer these first)
- Is the $4,800 in student loan interest paid in 2023, or does that total cover multiple earlier years (2016–2020)? Only interest paid in 2023 can be deducted on 2023 returns.  
- Are the $1,350 “unreimbursed expenses” business expenses related to the $22,100 of marketing/freelance work (i.e., self‑employment expenses)? Or were they unreimbursed employee expenses tied to your W-2 job? (Unreimbursed employee expenses are not deductible for 2018–2025.)
