What you have (from your message)
- Filing status: Married filing jointly (2023).  
- W‑2 wages: $79,400.  
- Self-employment (marketing, 6 clients): $22,100.  
- Interest income: $920 (Chase savings), $290 (TD Ameritrade) — taxable interest.  
