2. Are the $1,350 “unreimbursed expenses” business-related (for your self-employed marketing) or related to a W-2 employer?
3. Do you have other deductible items (mortgage interest, property tax, state income tax paid, large medical expenses) not listed?
4. How much federal tax was withheld on your W-2(s) and did you make any estimated tax payments for 2023?
5. Do you want me to run a more detailed estimate of your 2023 tax liability (I can use either the actual or simplified home-office method — tell me which you prefer)?

